    "detailed_description": "VR's Ultimate Action-Platformer <br><br>Obsessed with his family's legacy, aging billionaire Adam Venture is looking for a capable heir to the Venture name and fortune. His only requirement? The skill and tenacity to overcome a series of deadly obstacle courses known as: Venture\u2019s Gauntlet<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840140/extras/6b28e43453b56fe58e900295b962de9e.poster.avif?t=1716475665\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840140/extras/6b28e43453b56fe58e900295b962de9e.webm?t=1716475665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840140/extras/6b28e43453b56fe58e900295b962de9e.mp4?t=1716475665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Comfortable Locomotion</h2><br>Run, climb, swing and zipline your way through the gauntlet in comfort and style with TrueMotionVR arm swing controls.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overcome Dangerous Challenges</h2><br>Killer-drones, deadly lasers, fatal drops and more all stand along the path to glory. Only the most capable will survive.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840140/extras/717e1871af2dfba8478ace6c85b7630b.poster.avif?t=1716475665\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840140/extras/717e1871af2dfba8478ace6c85b7630b.webm?t=1716475665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840140/extras/717e1871af2dfba8478ace6c85b7630b.mp4?t=1716475665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Embark On An Epic Journey</h2><br>Traverse giant cliffs, delve into the depths of the earth and climb crumbling castles across 9 intense stages inspired by the Highlands of Scotland.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840140/extras/3b3b22978e3ee886a545f71636058bcd.poster.avif?t=1716475665\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840140/extras/3b3b22978e3ee886a545f71636058bcd.webm?t=1716475665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840140/extras/3b3b22978e3ee886a545f71636058bcd.mp4?t=1716475665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Breathtaking Visuals - Experience beautiful graphics powered by Unreal Engine. A dynamic time of day and weather system makes the world feel alive as you progress through the Gauntlet.<br></li><li>Uncover the secrets of the Ventures - The ever-present Adam Venture watches your every move. Do you have the skill to impress him or will you be a disappointment like all the others?<br></li><li>Tailor Made Courses - Calibration adjusts the Gauntlet\u2019s obstacles to your height &amp; arm length measurements to ensure the best experience for all users.<br></li><li>Claim the ultimate glory - Compete against other players for the best times on each stage on the online leaderboards.<br></li><li>Level Up Your Fitness - Venture\u2019s Gauntlet is the most difficult parkour/assault course experience currently available on VR\u2013you will be physically challenged when playing this game!</li></ul>",
